# The bootstrap image. Emitted by `zig build image` into the install prefix and
# by every build into the cache, both of which are ignored above -- this is for
# the case where one is written into the tree by hand, which `image-diff.py
# --save` invites. It is 324KB of marshalled bytes regenerated by every build
# and belongs in the repository no more than an object file does.
janet-image.bin

